<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: hemophage warcasket -->
  <HPWC_Warcasket_Hemophage.label>噬血型戰棺裝甲</HPWC_Warcasket_Hemophage.label>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket shell with improved heat protection, equipped with hemogen injectors that replace the pilot's blood pumping and can spend hemogen to make the pilot faster and stronger. -->
  <HPWC_Warcasket_Hemophage.shortDescription>特化型太空科技戰棺裝甲，強化了隔熱性能。配備血原注射器，能接手駕駛員的血液循環，並可消耗血原讓駕駛員變得更快、更強。</HPWC_Warcasket_Hemophage.shortDescription>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket shell with improved heat protection, equipped with hemogen injectors that replace the pilot's blood pumping and can spend hemogen to make the pilot faster and stronger.\n\nThe 10th generation came out of a government program that rebuilt captured pirate rigs around its own power armor and gave them to veterans who could no longer serve any other way. The program has no record of a Hemophage series. Some think the designs were stolen and refitted by sanguophages. Some believe the series was sanctioned in secret from the top of the program, which sanguophages had directed all along.\n\nThe Hemophage series runs on its pilot's hemogen. Injectors in the shell keep the pilot's blood pumping even without a heart, and can spend hemogen quickly to make the pilot much faster and stronger. Servos in the pauldrons can tear a limb off an enemy so the pilot can drain hemogen from the wound, and the helmet keeps out sunlight and helps the pilot hold their nerve near fire. For a non-hemogenic pilot this series is somewhat lackluster, but it suits a sanguophage who prefers to fight up close. -->
  <HPWC_Warcasket_Hemophage.description>特化型太空科技戰棺裝甲，強化了隔熱性能。配備血原注射器，能接手駕駛員的血液循環，並可消耗血原讓駕駛員變得更快、更強。\n\n第十代戰棺出自一項政府計畫。政府用自家的動力裝甲改造收繳來的海盜裝備，再配發給無法以其他方式繼續服役的老兵。然而，計畫的紀錄中從未出現過噬血型系列。有些人認為，這些設計是被噬血者偷走後改裝的。也有人認為，這個系列是由計畫高層秘密批准的，而整個計畫從一開始就由噬血者在暗中指揮。\n\n噬血型系列以駕駛員的血原為動力。即使駕駛員沒有心臟，裝甲裡的注射器也能維持血液循環，還能快速消耗血原，大幅提升駕駛員的速度和力量。護肩裡的伺服機構能扯下敵人的肢體，讓駕駛員從傷口汲取血原。頭盔則能擋住陽光，並讓駕駛員在火邊保持鎮定。對非血原性的駕駛員來說，這個系列略顯平庸，但很適合偏好近身作戰的噬血者。</HPWC_Warcasket_Hemophage.description>

  <!-- EN: hemophage warcasket shoulders -->
  <HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.label>噬血型戰棺護肩</HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.label>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket pauldrons with improved heat protection, equipped with powerful servos and reinforced arms that can tear a limb off an enemy. -->
  <HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.shortDescription>特化型太空科技戰棺護肩，強化了隔熱性能。配備強力伺服機構和強化機械臂，足以扯下敵人的肢體。</HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.shortDescription>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket pauldrons with improved heat protection, equipped with powerful servos and reinforced arms that can tear a limb off an enemy.\n\nThe 10th generation came out of a government program that rebuilt captured pirate rigs around its own power armor and gave them to veterans who could no longer serve any other way. The program has no record of a Hemophage series. Some think the designs were stolen and refitted by sanguophages. Some believe the series was sanctioned in secret from the top of the program, which sanguophages had directed all along.\n\nThe Hemophage series runs on its pilot's hemogen. Injectors in the shell keep the pilot's blood pumping even without a heart, and can spend hemogen quickly to make the pilot much faster and stronger. Servos in the pauldrons can tear a limb off an enemy so the pilot can drain hemogen from the wound, and the helmet keeps out sunlight and helps the pilot hold their nerve near fire. For a non-hemogenic pilot this series is somewhat lackluster, but it suits a sanguophage who prefers to fight up close. -->
  <HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.description>特化型太空科技戰棺護肩，強化了隔熱性能。配備強力伺服機構和強化機械臂，足以扯下敵人的肢體。\n\n第十代戰棺出自一項政府計畫。政府用自家的動力裝甲改造收繳來的海盜裝備，再配發給無法以其他方式繼續服役的老兵。然而，計畫的紀錄中從未出現過噬血型系列。有些人認為，這些設計是被噬血者偷走後改裝的。也有人認為，這個系列是由計畫高層秘密批准的，而整個計畫從一開始就由噬血者在暗中指揮。\n\n噬血型系列以駕駛員的血原為動力。即使駕駛員沒有心臟，裝甲裡的注射器也能維持血液循環，還能快速消耗血原，大幅提升駕駛員的速度和力量。護肩裡的伺服機構能扯下敵人的肢體，讓駕駛員從傷口汲取血原。頭盔則能擋住陽光，並讓駕駛員在火邊保持鎮定。對非血原性的駕駛員來說，這個系列略顯平庸，但很適合偏好近身作戰的噬血者。</HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.description>
  <!-- EN: strike -->
  <HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.comps.CompStrikePool.chargeNoun>打擊</HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.comps.CompStrikePool.chargeNoun>
  <!-- EN: on cooldown -->
  <HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.comps.CompStrikePool.cooldownGerund>冷卻</HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.comps.CompStrikePool.cooldownGerund>

  <!-- EN: hemophage warcasket helmet -->
  <HPWC_WarcasketHelmet_Hemophage.label>噬血型戰棺頭盔</HPWC_WarcasketHelmet_Hemophage.label>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket helmet with improved impact dispersion and heat protection, equipped with a visor that shields the pilot from sunlight and makes them less likely to flee from fire. -->
  <HPWC_WarcasketHelmet_Hemophage.shortDescription>特化型太空科技戰棺頭盔，強化了衝擊分散和隔熱性能。配備的面罩能替駕駛員遮擋陽光，並降低其遇火逃離的機率。</HPWC_WarcasketHelmet_Hemophage.shortDescription>
